y teammate\'s King is already a strong play that forces the Landlord to use a top card (Ace, 2, or Bomb) or pass. I should not beat my teammate\'s high card unnecessarily. Passing preserves my Pair of Aces and my single 2 for more critical moments, while relying on the Rocket to guarantee control later in the game.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
